  "html": "\n<figure>\n<figure><img width=\"730\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031688-730x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031688-730x1024.jpg 730w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031688-214x300.jpg 214w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031688-768x1077.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031688-1096x1536.jpg 1096w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031688.jpg 1179w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 730px) 100vw, 730px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img width=\"729\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031689-729x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031689-729x1024.jpg 729w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031689-214x300.jpg 214w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031689-768x1078.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031689-1094x1536.jpg 1094w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/1000031689.jpg 1179w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 729px) 100vw, 729px\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<div><figure><img width=\"640\" height=\"640\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/aicanvas-robot-8634899_640.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/aicanvas-robot-8634899_640.jpg 640w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/aicanvas-robot-8634899_640-300x300.jpg 300w, /ollie-tree-redesign/cn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/aicanvas-robot-8634899_640-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\"></figure><div>\n<p><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f4e2/32.png\" alt=\"📢\">&nbsp; 橄榄树基金会青少年团契 OllieTree Youth</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h4><strong>解锁未来科技：Agentic AI 智能体探索营</strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<p>不仅是“聊天的 AI”，更是“能行动的 AI”！全新 <strong>Agentic AI 课程</strong>重磅来袭，带你亲眼见证并亲自打造拥有自主思考力的下一代人工智能。<strong>⏰ 9 月 13 日 公开体验课</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f388/32.png\" alt=\"🎈\"><strong>报名截止日期： 9 月 12 日（名额有限，抢先锁定）费用：$150</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>👉 <strong>点击链接/扫描下方二维码，开启你的 AI 探险之旅：</strong>🔗<a href=\"http://forms.gle/BVRGdFHCeiv8c7X16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">http://forms.gle/BVRGdFHCeiv8c7X16</a></p>\n\n\n\n<h5><strong>✨ 课程三大核心亮点</strong></h5>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>深度探索黑科技</strong> ｜ 解密 AI Agent 如何<strong>自主推理、制定计划、调用工具</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>趣味实战超有料</strong> ｜ 拒绝枯燥理论！通过多个上手项目（Hands-on Projects）玩转 AI</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>硬核技能赋能未来</strong> ｜ 提前掌握面向未来的核心竞争与技术思维</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Especially since artificial intelligence can be observed to evolve rapidly, it is imperative that an understanding of AI will be invaluable for students in the near future. Our new Agentic AI class will not only give students an exciting opportunity&nbsp;&nbsp;to learn about AI, but also how AI agents can reason, plan, use tools, and more!!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Through several hands-on learning lessons and many more engaging activities, students can look forward in exploring how the next generation of AI will work and develop beneficial skills for the future and beyond!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Interested? Registration will start TODAY and ends September 12th!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Link for signing-up: <a href=\"http://forms.gle/BVRGdFHCeiv8c7X16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">forms.gle/BVRGdFHCeiv8c7X16</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<figure><blockquote><cite><strong><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe98RRccMtuHnWW2d_G52arY3QEj7xrB7ft__6TJJZegWuAHQ/viewform\">OllieTree STEM Course: </a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe98RRccMtuHnWW2d_G52arY3QEj7xrB7ft__6TJJZegWuAHQ/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Agentic AI</a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe98RRccMtuHnWW2d_G52arY3QEj7xrB7ft__6TJJZegWuAHQ/viewform\"> (Fall 2026) Registration</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe98RRccMtuHnWW2d_G52arY3QEj7xrB7ft__6TJJZegWuAHQ/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">现在就开始报名！</a></strong></cite></blockquote></figure>\n\n\n\n<hr>\n\n\n<div class=\"form-placeholder\"><p>报名表即将上线（占位）</p></div>,<!-- 2026-8-12-->    <div class=\"row\">     <input type=\"button\" class=\"btn\">     <input type=\"button\" class=\"btn\">          <div>         Note: when you click the “Payment Confirmation” button, you will go to the Paypal payment page. After the         payment is successful, <b>the page will pause for about 3 seconds. You do not need to do anything,</b> and the         page will be refreshed with automatic reminder that you should receive payment acknowledgement email for this payment         transaction.         <br>提示:当您点击‘Payment Confirmation 确认’ 按钮后，确认弹出的提示对话框，然后出现蓝色‘Payment 付款’按钮,点击‘Payment 付款’按钮就会转到Paypal付款页面,<b>付款成功后页面会暂停3秒钟,您无需任何操作，</b>页面自动新刷新提示您我们已经发送邮件给您。谢谢。     </div>   </div>,\n\n\n\n\n"
